<h2>5. Practical Strategies to Support Healthy Metabolism</h2>
<p>Shedding body fat is about creating healthy, repeatable habits. Stay steady, track your progress, and adjust as your body adapts. Customize your nutrition with our<a class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline" href="../dietplanner.html">Custom Diet Planner</a>and get a clear plan via our<a class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline" href="../workoutplanner.html">Workout Routine Planner</a>.</p>
